{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_08_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_08","title":"种因","storyCode":"HS-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"42eb3ba944e0e319e968cc1c84694ada136b4bff0ec6cd8e1e0271d4fd34ac1b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"暗无天日。\n不知地深几许，没有半点阳光透进来，空气也凝重得仿佛能感受到穹顶的重量。\n这是一座陵墓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啥情况......我回这来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老东西，还活着么？我来看看你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（喑哑的嘶吼）"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前是一扇厚重的大门，声音是从门后传来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡了这么久，火气是半点都没少啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别装模作样吓唬人了，在这里躺了这么长时间，你真的还剩下什么能耐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没啥子好怕的......吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚蜀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是哪座山头，怎么连块路牌都没有......不对，这是哪一年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看这路上两边的房子，像是没有移动地块的样子......怎么像是我刚来尚蜀的时候？"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮——当——\n一人正用绳子将自己悬在陡峭的山崖上，用一锤一凿在悬壁上刻下一行行字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——山上那兄弟，你做啥子呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不认识我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为什么要认识你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这整座尚蜀城都是在我的设计下建造出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，厉害厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾就要来了，人都已经撤走了。但我建造的这些屋子，都要毁于这场天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靖炎五年，余至尚蜀，历三十载......《尚蜀城记》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把我建造这座城的过程全部刻在这山崖上，让后世亿兆百姓全部记得我的功绩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是天灾马上就要来了哎，就算你不惜命，一道天雷劈下来，这座山头都不一定保得住，你这不是白费功夫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管不了那么多了，我就只有这一个法子。要是没人知道我的作为，我还不如不活了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有这样的人......行吧，你接着忙活，我不打扰了哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，山上这条路最后通到哪儿啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恳请先生赐剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要剑，做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救人，报仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，我铸的剑很贵的，你用什么换？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我应该已经拒绝了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你记不记恨我，当年用一把破铜烂铁就打发了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在说什么，不过是个幻影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是您偏偏还记得我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是惦记着电影剧本的原型故事......还是忍不住会想，要是当时真的送你一把好剑，故事结局会不会有什么不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像您这样神通广大、见识无数的人，又怎会对我这样的无名之辈抱有恻隐之心呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"区区一个人类的命，对您来说，确实太不值钱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不能说得这么过分吧，我还是很喜欢你们人类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您看我们，就像看戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的随性之举，就能为这出戏添一处奇景，改变无数人的命运。到兴起的时候，您甚至也想加入进来，唱上几句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可戏里风景千万，唯独您不在戏中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年剑客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您始终孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，看走马灯这件事也能落到我的身上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乏了，这把剑是认真打的，你带走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就让我看看，故事结局还有没有什么变数。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，有一个少年，托我一定在今年冬至日前，把这个包裹交给您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不敢亲自来见我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他应该，已经死了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"包裹是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，在下恭候多时了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下有一事不解，请先生解惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来听听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，今日我去城郊采风，见到河边栖着一只奇异的羽兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没见过那么漂亮的羽兽......我正要掏出纸笔来画，它却振翅一飞，消失不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再想凭记忆里的印象去描绘它，却无论如何画不出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"力所不及的事，过去便过去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对其他人来说，过去也便过去了。可我姑且还自诩是个画家......是画家，总还是想留下点什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年来，也画了不少。总觉得只有画得够多，见过的风景够多，才算不枉这一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我终于想明白了一个道理......画，到底是死物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时画下的风景，下一瞬便是过眼云烟。画得越多，越觉得自己的画微不足道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是理所当然的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人生年不满百，想看遍这片大地只能是奢望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......先生应该还是没有明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有在下一幅拙作，还想请先生指点一二。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是画？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的画。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们肉眼凡胎，凡夫俗子，所见风景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是您这样的先生，您所行所见的风景，比起这片大地千年间天翻地覆的变化，也不过是沧海一粟罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，再好好看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都只有这一夕的时间了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长得真好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是你种的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这里的人们种的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你说的，我不能用我的能力来干涉这些庄稼的生长......总有一天我会消失不见的，但这里的人们还要生活很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是辛苦你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，黍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我那个弟弟也说，最近总会梦见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛总是要惦记我呢......是不是人上了年纪，就容易怀念过去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也会打趣我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在这里的人，都记得曾经有一位“神农”，总结了二十四节气，教给人们耕种的知识。还冒着生命危险，把万顷冻土开垦成良田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“神农”，我怎么担得起呢。明明是我们一起做过的事，你怎么好全推在我身上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去这么久了，还分什么你我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只记得，在我像一个孩子一样漫无目的地游荡的时候，有一个人把我留在了身边，给了我一个“家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她告诉我，不必在意什么人兽有别。我可以......我应该像一个人一样活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我没有想到，你还留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我答应过你的。守护好这片土地，让更多的人能吃饱饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍啊......你怨过我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一千年了，哪里谈得上是奉献呢？这分明是囚禁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你已经神识散尽，还要因为与这片土地的联系被困在这里，不得自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我犯下的一个错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会怨你......我只怨自己，最后没有替你去那趟北边的远行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍......你知道的，与你认识这么长时间，我从来没有一刻把你当作“神”，我甚至都快忘了这一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可直到最后与你分别的时候，我才意识到，我是有私心的，作为“人”的私心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想恳求你留下来，继续帮助这里的人们。我的无数同族，他们都需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不确定，你会不会爱他们，就像对我一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕，我让你失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还是失败了，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最终还是没有找到种子，我也没能研究出可以种在源石土壤上的庄稼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连这片土地，我们都没能保护下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人定胜天......人什么时候真的胜过天呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍......你后悔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说的这些，其实你早都知道的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本不该在这里见到我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是残留在这个装置里的一缕意识，我是这一点意识的回忆。罔两问景，多么悲哀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“自在”","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在你心里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命犯贪嗔，贪生怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都差点忘了，当时为什么会画你出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山高水遥无是处，无碍吾自在人间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浑浑噩噩了许久，我竟然连这点清醒都丢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁说要画遍世间万物才算画家，画出一山一水，便是一山一水的境界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"画家挥剑，层山尽起。\n我即为我。\n我见即万象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，醒醒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"在片场睡过去，作为导演也太失职了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"困了就睡嘛......我们现在拍的是哪一部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"《机械巨兽大战巨兽》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，这不是我压箱底的剧本吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是指离谱程度吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我发誓，今年一定是最后一年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嬉笑怒骂，皆成文章，传说志异，都是故事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，小炎熔啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么愿意陪我闹这么久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你答应我的传奇武器，什么时候给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然还是惦记这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是哪天，我消失得无影无踪，再也找不到——你会想我不？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"真有那么一天，不会有人记得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你造出来的武器，工具，城市，还有那些电影，全都会消失不见......你明知道这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得对......我也不该在这见到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，说得没错。我折腾的这些玩意，说到底都是白费功夫。可忍不住，就是要找点乐子，留点念想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"东西留过，我也开心过，这就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你啊，小炎熔。在罗德岛上有你陪着胡闹的这些日子，还挺开心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丢脸......明明是自己造出来的东西，还要反过来教训我一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动不动让别人翻陈芝麻烂谷子的记忆，实在是件很矫情的事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了吧，能从那团混沌中分出来，我们已经回答过那个问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一颗心脏而已，就别妄想再收我们回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家伙，我们辛辛苦苦从暗无天日的陵墓里走出来，不是为了继续活在你的阴影下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]}]}
